### US04 - View personal profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/profile/read/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: JWT {{accessToken}}

###

### US04 - View personal profile without token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/profile/read/ HTTP/1.1

###

### US04 - View personal profile with invalid token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/profile/read/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: JWT invalid.token.value

###

### US05 - Edit profile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/profile/update/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: JWT {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "first_name": "ana",
    "last_name": "rusu",
    "bio": "LectioSphere REST Client test profile."
}

###

### US05 - Verify profile after edit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/profile/read/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: JWT {{accessToken}}

###

