### US06 - View existing user's profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/profile/{{otherProfileId}}/details/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: JWT {{accessToken}}

###

### US06 - View nonexistent user's profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/profile/{{missingProfileId}}/details/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: JWT {{accessToken}}

